        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "VISKOL 2003 DOO deals in energy and natural gas trade.\n\nVISKOL 2003 DOO is a member of the Central European Gas Hub – CEGH  located in Vienna, Austria.\n\nVISKOL 2003 DOO deals with international trade in natural gas and other energy products in Europe.\n"
